I'm all for referencing long-gone roguelikes when appropriate. A
special boss that appears on the up staircase of DL1 when you have the
Amulet sounds nice. But maybe not "Lucifer"...

On topic: If I was adding Demon Lords, I'd add Bel-Shamharoth
(Discworld mythos). - he's got grappling tentacles and a draining gaze.
Of course, his weakness to flashes of light may render him as durable
as Jubilex...

